<title>THAILAND: Thailand's 1996 exports contract 0.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Thailand's 1996 exports contract 0.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's exports contracted 0.2 percent in 1996, against growth of 23.6 percent posted in 1995,the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday</p>
<p>Thailand has been alarmed at the sudden sharp drop in exports growth and the government has vowed to take measures to counter the flagging situation.</p>
<p>The central bank had originally expected a 0.1 percent contraction in export growth for 1996.</p>
</text>
